msgstr "Connect your Meta account, build the campaign with what you generated and publish it. It's always paused when created; you decide when it spends and you see the results here."

msgid ""
"Conecta tu cuenta de Triple Whale para traer métricas de anuncios por canal y\n"
"  modelo de atribución. Los experimentos pueden usar estas métricas en lugar de\n"
"  los datos de Meta Pixel o la tienda para decidir ganadores y perdedores."
msgstr ""
"Connect your Triple Whale account to bring in ad metrics by channel and\n"
"  attribution model. Experiments can use these metrics instead of\n"
"  Meta Pixel or store data to decide winners and losers."

msgid ""
"Conecta tu tienda para traer el catálogo solo (cada 6 h) y, en Shopify y\n"
"  WooCommerce, leer los pedidos que llegan con una pieza en la URL — así un\n"
"  experimento sabe qué vendió aunque no haya Pixel. Solo lectura: nunca se\n"
"  cambia nada en la tienda."
msgstr ""
"Connect your store to bring in the catalog only (every 6 h) and, on Shopify and\n"
"  WooCommerce, read the orders that arrive with a piece in the URL — so an\n"
"  experiment knows what sold even without a Pixel. Read-only: nothing ever\n"
"  changes in the store."

