msgstr "Does it see the product photo?"

msgid "¿Volver a usar tu propia app de Meta? Creatv deja de operar este proyecto; si tenías tu propia conexión se restaura."
msgstr "Go back to using your own Meta app? Creatv stops operating this project; if you had your own connection it's restored."

